"finding": "Sigrid Eskilsdotter (Banér) had at least two children mentioned: Cecilia Månsdotter and Christina Gyllenstierna. The document mentions that Sigrid Eskilsdotter was the mother of Cecilia Månsdotter, who is listed as 'mother of king Gustav Vasa'. It also states that Sigrid married Nils Eriksson (Gyllenstierna) and her issue included Christina Gyllenstierna. Passage 4 confirms Christina Gyllenstierna became 'the mother of Svante Turesson Bielke.'",
"answer": null,
"next_query": "What are the children of Cecilia Månsdotter or Christina Gyllenstierna?"}
